ile\"><img alt=\"Strawberry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Strawberry_a09de0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Strawberry</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\"><img alt=\"White Mushroom\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Mushroom_c1cb03.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Serafin.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nSerafin: Welcome to my fruit and vegetable store, <i>Player</i>! Ask me for a <b>trade</b> if you'd like to see my wares.<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nSerafin: I'm Serafin, pleased to meet you.<br/>\nPlayer: job<br/>\nSerafin: Oh, I'm selling fruits and veggies as you can see. If you want to have a closer look, ask me for a <b>trade</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: trade<br/>\nSerafin: Oh, sure, take a look!<br/>\nPlayer: quest / mission<br/>\nSerafin: Sorry, but I already have a delivery boy.<br/>\nPlayer: quarter<br/>\nSerafin: Well, actually this is not a quarter but the city centre.<br/>\nPlayer: blood<br/>\nSerafin: This is a fruit store. No slaughterhouse.<br/>\nPlayer: cookie<br/>\nSerafin: Oh, no I don't sell cookies.<br/>\nPlayer: garlic<br/>\nSerafin: I'm so sorry, but I don't sell garlic.<br/>\nPlayer: vampire<br/>\nSerafin: I don't know what you're talking about.<br/>\nPlayer: alori mort<br/>\nSerafin: There's something about these words which makes me feel awkward. Or maybe it's you who causes that feeling. You better get lost.<br/>\nPlayer: Augur<br/>\nSerafin: They are desperately trying to get the city under control. I don't envy them.<br/>\nPlayer: Armenius<br/>\nSerafin: I think he runs a bar in the former trade quarter.<br/>\nPlayer: Julius<br/>\nSerafin: I think that poor guy has serious trust issues... must be hard if you are obsessed with the idea that everyone is your enemy or a monster.<br/>\nPlayer: Lisander<br/>\nSerafin: Oh yes, I see him often. Nice guy.<br/>\nPlayer: Maris<br/>\nSerafin: A man of the seas.<br/>\nPlayer: Ortheus<br/>\nSerafin: I like him, but unfortunately I don't have much time to chat with him anymore.<br/>\nPlayer: Yalahar<br/>\nSerafin: Oh, this lovely city is a great place to live and to do business.<br/>\nPlayer: bye<br/>\nSerafin: Good bye, my dear customer.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Serafin</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["blood-brothers-quest"],"pos":{"x":32852,"y":31209,"z":7}}